
How to use this source to build protomuck. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Instructions for Visual Studio 2012
--------------------------------------------------
1. Open the ext folder
2. Run get_libraries.bat
3. Open proto2.sln
4. Select 'build solution'

Congratulations, you've built protomuck. 


